## Not used on tvOS (no camera)
!missing-enum! RPCameraPosition not bound

# SCStreamErrorDomain is from ScreenCaptureKit, but only macOS and Mac Catalyst.
# However, Apple seems to also have added it to ReplayKit for iOS and tvOS, which is why xtro detects it as such.
# It doesn't seem useful though in ReplayKit, so just skip binding it.
!missing-field! SCStreamErrorDomain not bound

